  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.6.0:\n• Generate nested [Notify] classes safely across partial containing types\n• Add NOTIFY006 with a Make type partial code fix for containing declarations\n• Reject static, const, and readonly fields consistently before generation\n• Preserve generic syntax, modifiers, escaped identifiers, and collision-safe source hints\n• Report NOTIFY003 when [NotifyAlso] targets a property from an ineligible field",
